{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0026","name":"伍子胥","evidence":["zhangle-q-o029","zhangle-q-b-75d3c0ebecc7c687f5ad"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o029-zhangle-p0026","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o029","zhangle-q-b-75d3c0ebecc7c687f5ad"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-q-b-75d3c0ebecc7c687f5ad","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-75d3c0ebecc7c687f5ad","layer":"modern","quote":"〖3〗子胥：即伍子胥。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5cec132aabe3e6cb58d9","start":0,"end":11},{"id":"zhangle-q-o029","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-a4ccf00fcd84c9fc6e1a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖与袁绍相拒于官渡。﹝一﹞绍遣将淳于琼等督运，屯乌巢，太祖自将急击之。郃说绍曰：“曹公兵精，往必破琼等；琼等破，则将军事去矣：宜急引兵救之！”郭图曰：“郃计非也！不如攻其本营，势必还；此为不救而自解也。”郃曰：“曹公营固，攻之必不拔；若琼等见擒，吾属尽为虏矣。”绍但遣轻骑救琼；而以重兵攻太祖营，不能下。太祖果破琼等，绍军溃。图惭，又更谮郃曰：“郃快军败〖2〗，出言不逊。”郃惧，乃归太祖。﹝二﹞太祖得郃甚喜，谓曰：“昔子胥不早悟〖3〗，自使身危；岂若微子去殷、韩信归汉邪！”","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":239}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
